msgctxt "share.defaultMessage"
msgid ""
"Arroxy — free, open-source video downloader for Windows, macOS & Linux. Works with YouTube, Vimeo, Twitch, and 2000+ sites.\n"
"4K · HDR · MP3 · Shorts · Subtitles · SponsorBlock"
msgstr ""
"Arroxy — ነፃ እና ክፍት-ምንጭ የቪዲዮ አውራጅ ለ Windows፣ macOS እና Linux። ከ YouTube፣ Vimeo፣ Twitch እና ከ2000+ ሌሎች ጣቢያዎች ጋር ይሰራል።\n"
"4K · HDR · MP3 · Shorts · Subtitles · SponsorBlock"

